Source common.tape
Output scratch.gif
Hide
Type "tmux -L revamped-screens attach -t demo"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show
Sleep 800ms
Hide
Ctrl+]
Type@5ms "prefix |"
Enter
Show
Ctrl+B
Type@1ms "|"
Sleep 1s
Hide
Ctrl+]
Type@5ms "prefix c"
Enter
Show
Ctrl+B
Type@1ms "c"
Sleep 2s
Screenshot window.png
Sleep 1s
Hide
Ctrl+]
Type@5ms "prefix p"
Enter
Show
Ctrl+B
Type@1ms "p"
Sleep 1s
Hide
Ctrl+]
Type@5ms "prefix -"
Enter
Show
Ctrl+B
Type@1ms "-"
Sleep 1s
Hide
Ctrl+]
Type@5ms "prefix !"
Enter
Show
Ctrl+B
Type@1ms "!"
Sleep 2s
Screenshot break.png
Sleep 1s
Hide
Ctrl+]
Type@5ms "prefix @, Escape"
Enter
Show
Ctrl+B
Type@1ms "@"
Sleep 1s
Screenshot join.png
Sleep 1s
Escape
Sleep 500ms
Hide
Ctrl+]
Type@5ms "prefix m"
Enter
Show
Ctrl+B
Type@1ms "m"
